  "description": "The Horizon Tour 20 is designed for low-maintenance commuting and practical daily use, bringing a reliable feel to every ride. LED lighting helps keep you visible in traffic, and the Racktime carrier with KID'n'CARRY and SNAPIT 2.0 compatibility makes carrying gear or a child seat simple.\n\nIts belt-drive and internal gear hub reduce upkeep while delivering consistently smooth shifting. An adjustable stem allows you to customize your riding position, and SP Connect provides a secure solution for mounting your smartphone. A 100mm suspension fork improves comfort over uneven pavement and rough patches. Schwalbe Energizer Plus tires ensure strong puncture protection and dependable traction for everyday urban travel.\n\nThe Bosch Performance Line motor provides quiet, steady support, and the 540Wh PowerTube battery removes easily for charging. Compatible with the Bosch PowerMore battery and with connectivity functions available through the Bosch eBike Flow App, it's ready for both short trips and weekend explorations.",
